<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="wrap"><h1>Trademark &amp; copyright disclosure</h1><p class="muted">Last updated: {{TODAY}}</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap prose">
<h2>Our name</h2>
<p>"Geo.Vision" is the name of this website, derived from its domain name geo.vision and always written with the dot. It describes the site's subject — a view ("vision") of the Earth ("geo"). Geo.Vision is <b>not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by or connected to GeoVision Inc.</b> (a video-surveillance company) or any other business using a similar name, and offers no security, surveillance or camera products or services. Any similarity in names is coincidental and no confusion or association is intended. We do not use any third party's logos, trade dress or product names as our own.</p>
<h2>Other trademarks</h2>
<p>NASA, USGS, Google, YouTube, AdSense, Esri, ArcGIS, OpenStreetMap, PayPal and all other names mentioned are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners. They are used only to identify sources of data, services or content, which constitutes nominative fair use. Their use does not imply endorsement. Geo.Vision is not affiliated with any of these organisations.</p>
<h2>Copyright</h2>
<p>&copy; {{YEAR}} Geo.Vision. Original text, page designs, graphics and source code on this site are protected by copyright. You may link to any page and quote short excerpts with attribution and a link.</p>
